				"edit `prd.jsonc` to insert new one-iteration implementation stories derived from `valibot-discovery.md` (dependencies first), directly after this story; renumber story ids to remain sequential",
				"Typecheck passes"
			],
			"passes": true,
			"notes": "baseline: draft2020-12 85.0%, draft2019-09 84.0%, draft7 88.7%, draft6 87.6%, draft4 87.0%, draft3 89.7%. major issues: ~100 'ignores non-X' type coercion failures, propertyNames not enforced, type:object accepts arrays, JS prototype property names cause runtime errors."
		},
		{
			"id": "US-010",
			"title": "valibot adapter: type-coercion passthrough",
			"description": "as a maintainer, i want valibot validators to pass (not reject) values of wrong types, so that keywords like maxLength, pattern, minimum only validate matching types per JSON Schema spec.",
			"acceptanceCriteria": [
				"keywords (maxLength, minLength, pattern, minimum, maximum, etc) pass validation for non-matching types instead of rejecting",
				"~100 'ignores non-X' tests pass in valibot compliance",
