			"passes": true,
			"notes": "derived from US-009. fixed ~247 tests total via renderTypeGuarded fix. draft2020-12: 85.0%→90.0%, draft2019-09: 84.0%→89.2%, draft7: 88.7%→94.1%, draft6: 87.6%→93.5%, draft4: 87.0%→94.0%, draft3: 89.7%→95.6%."
